 "datePublished": "2025-12-02",
 "description": "Written by Deacon Mihret Melaku from the Ethiopian Orthodox Tewahedo Church, this book dives into the differences between Orthodox Christianity and Protestantism, particularly in the fields of scripture, the saints, iconography, salvation, the sacraments, and the church. Deacon Mihret presents scriptural, patristic, and historical evidence to show the Orthodox Church is justified to holding onto the faith preserved for 2,000 years. ASIN ‏ : ‎ B0G547X9HV Publisher ‏ : ‎ Independently published Publication date ‏ : ‎ December 2, 2025 Language ‏ : ‎ English Print length ‏ : ‎ 384 pages ISBN-13 ‏ : ‎ 979-8276858029 Item Weight ‏ : ‎ 1.44 pounds Reading age ‏ : ‎ 16 - 18 years Dimensions ‏ : ‎ 6 x 0.87 x 9 inches Best Sellers Rank: #7,605 in Books (See Top 100 in Books) #2 in Ecclesiology Christian Theology (Books) #3 in Christian Systematic Theology (Books) #26 in Christian Apologetics (Books)",
